      "category": "transport",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Bloor–Danforth line reached Islington in 1968, establishing Islington station at Islington Avenue and Bloor Street West.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        11
